{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_070EF0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"好了，Snake小子。你也知道，NORAD肩负着一项重大任务：追踪圣诞老人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":94,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"唉……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"不过除此之外，他们还有从成立之初就肩负的本职任务。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"而为执行这项任务建立的机制……这次被Coldman利用了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":73,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"……你是说Peace Walker发送伪造数据的事？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"NORAD的早期预警系统，由DSP卫星搭载的红外传感器，以及设置在北美大陆各地的监视雷达组成。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":125,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"预警网发出的警报会被送往<R= NORAD ,CHEYENNE MOUNTAIN>，再由人类进行情报评估。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R= NORAD ,CHEYENNE MOUNTAIN>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":101,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED; SOURCE_RUBY_SPACING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"而Peace Walker必须自主决定是否采取报复行动。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"因此，它会通过保密线路自动接收与NORAD相同的情报。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"这条线路也用于<R=遥测,TELEMETRY>实验机AI所作出的报复判断。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=遥测,TELEMETRY>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":79,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"Peace Walker反过来利用了这套机制，在演习计划之外的时点向NORAD送入了“核导弹来袭”的假警报。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":128,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"要说系统在漏洞防护上存在问题，我也无从反驳。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"但让AI去实施破解，完全超出了当时的设想。结果你也知道了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":83,"review_flag":""}]}